        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nleft to right direction\n\n&#39; ============================================================\n&#39; CLIENT NODE\n&#39; ============================================================\nnode \&quot;Client PC\&quot; &lt;&lt;device&gt;&gt; {\n    node \&quot;Browser / App Runtime\&quot; &lt;&lt;execution environment&gt;&gt; {\n        artifact \&quot;GUI.spa\&quot; &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n        artifact \&quot;ClientSession.js\&quot; &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n        artifact \&quot;QRScanner.js\&quot; &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n        artifact \&quot;MediaPlayer.js\&quot; &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; ============================================================\n&#39; SERVER NODE\n&#39; ============================================================\nnode \&quot;Application Server\&quot; &lt;&lt;device&gt;&gt; {\n    node \&quot;Docker / JVM\&quot; &lt;&lt;execution environment&gt;&gt; {\n        artifact \&quot;AuthServer.jar\&quot; &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n        artifact \&quot;ArtifactManager.jar\&quot; &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n        artifact \&quot;AudioStreamer.jar\&quot; &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; ============================================================\n&#39; STORAGE &amp; DATABASE NODE\n&#39; ============================================================\nnode \&quot;Database Server\&quot; &lt;&lt;device&gt;&gt; {\n    node \&quot;DBMS Engine\&quot; &lt;&lt;execution environment&gt;&gt; {\n        database \&quot;System DB\&quot; &lt;&lt;database system&gt;&gt;\n    }\n}\n\nnode \&quot;Media Storage Server\&quot; &lt;&lt;device&gt;&gt; {\n    node \&quot;File Storage Service\&quot; &lt;&lt;execution environment&gt;&gt; {\n        artifact \&quot;MediaArchive.storage\&quot; &lt;&lt;artifact&gt;&gt;\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; ============================================================\n&#39; COMMUNICATION PATHS (Node to Node)\n&#39; ============================================================\n\&quot;Client PC\&quot; -- \&quot;Application Server\&quot; : HTTPS / REST API\n\&quot;Application Server\&quot; -- \&quot;Database Server\&quot; : JDBC / TCP\n\&quot;Application Server\&quot; -- \&quot;Media Storage Server\&quot; : HTTP / REST API\n\n&#39; ============================================================\n&#39; DEPLOY RELATIONSHIPS\n&#39; ============================================================\n\&quot;GUI.spa\&quot;             ..&gt; \&quot;Browser / App Runtime\&quot;  : &lt;&lt;deploy&gt;&gt;\n\&quot;ClientSession.js\&quot;    ..&gt; \&quot;Browser / App Runtime\&quot;  : &lt;&lt;deploy&gt;&gt;\n\&quot;QRScanner.js\&quot;        ..&gt; \&quot;Browser / App Runtime\&quot;  : &lt;&lt;deploy&gt;&gt;\n\&quot;MediaPlayer.js\&quot;      ..&gt; \&quot;Browser / App Runtime\&quot;  : &lt;&lt;deploy&gt;&gt;\n\n\&quot;AuthServer.jar\&quot;      ..&gt; \&quot;Docker / JVM\&quot;           : &lt;&lt;deploy&gt;&gt;\n\&quot;ArtifactManager.jar\&quot; ..&gt; \&quot;Docker / JVM\&quot;           : &lt;&lt;deploy&gt;&gt;\n\&quot;AudioStreamer.jar\&quot;   ..&gt; \&quot;Docker / JVM\&quot;            : &lt;&lt;deploy&gt;&gt;\n\n\&quot;System DB\&quot;           ..&gt; \&quot;DBMS Engine\&quot;            : &lt;&lt;deploy&gt;&gt;\n\&quot;MediaArchive.storage\&quot; ..&gt; \&quot;File Storage Service\&quot;  : &lt;&lt;deploy&gt;&gt;\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="r0A9IIhiuH9c7ogWZ4i7-1">
